{"1525470552856662016":{"a":"<p>What else could Optimus Subprime (Teslabot) be useful for? How does Khan Academy relate? We have a _lot_ of people who need education and not enough teachers. We all could automate the repetitive stuff and one on one tutoring. See Also 🤯 Android Teachers: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HhfMianm3zs\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/HhfMianm3zs\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HhfMianm3zs\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 1525470552856662016</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1525470552856662016\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-05-14T13:38:16Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1525502626699288576":{"a":"<p>My elementary school (2-6 grade) is located next to a Monarch butterfly preserve. We studied some aspect of it every year. Fascinating creatures. <a href=\"https://x.com/taraduggan/status/1525155004952088577\">Tweet by @taraduggan</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/taraduggan/status/1525155004952088577\">https://x.com/taraduggan/status/1525155004952088577</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1525502626699288576</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1525502626699288576\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-05-14T15:45:43Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1525503949767319557":{"a":"<p>RT @GissiSim: Ukrainian soldier on an ELEEK electric bike 🔥</p>\n<p>The Russians must be terrified knowing about these rapidly moving silent kille…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1525503949767319557\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1525503949767319557</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1525503949767319557</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1525503949767319557\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-05-14T15:50:58Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}